SUMMARY:Eihwar: Nordic Ritual Nights USA Tour 2026
DTSTAMP:20260822T032650Z
DTSTART:20260905T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Fans of Viking music\, get ready for the Nordic Rituals of EIHW
	AR! Hailing from Europe\, these feral warriors set Viking dance floors abl
	aze with their shamanic drums\, magical chants\, and powerful electro beat
	s. Backed by Season of Mist\, home to Heilung and Danheim\, Eihwar have bu
	rst onto the folk scene with millions of YouTube views and appearances at 
	festivals like Hellfest\, Wacken Open Air\, and Midgardsblot\, as well as 
	an invitation to open select shows for the Mongolian folk metal band The H
	U. Seize this exceptional opportunity to see them live in the United State
	s for the first time. [www.eihwar.com] Doors: 7pm This show is ALL AGES Al
	l General Admission Tickets are Standing Room only IMPORTANT: WHITE OAK MU
	SIC HALL IS A CASHLESS VENUE. Please be sure to bring a debit or credit ca
	rd.\nFans of Viking music\, get ready for the Nordic Rituals of EIHWAR! Ha
	iling from Europe\, these feral warriors set Viking dance floors ablaze wi
	th their shamanic drums\, magical chants\, and powerful electro beats. Bac
	ked by Season of Mist\, home to Heilung and Danheim\, Eihwar have burst on
	to the folk scene with millions of YouTube views and appearances at festiv
	als like Hellfest\, Wacken Open Air\, and Midgardsblot\, as well as an inv
	itation to open select shows for the Mongolian folk metal band The HU. Sei
	ze this exceptional opportunity to see them live in the United States for 
	the first time. [www.eihwar.com] Doors: 7pm This show is ALL AGES All Gene
	ral Admission Tickets are Standing Room only IMPORTANT: WHITE OAK MUSIC HA
	LL IS A CASHLESS VENUE. Please be sure to bring a debit or credit card.\n\
	nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/eihwar-nordic-ritual-nights-usa-tour-houston
	-texas-09-04-2026/event/3A00646DCE72F219\n\nFrom White Oak Music Hall
