UID:YD1Wy2RM7Ycq97vmXhRVj
SUMMARY:Mrs. Doubtfire
DTSTAMP:20260822T032650Z
DTSTART:20261013T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:A new musical comedy about the things we do to stay together\n	
			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Based on the beloved film\, Mrs. Doubtfire
	 tells the hysterical and heartfelt story of an out-of-work actor who will
	 do anything for his kids. It’s “the lovable\, big-hearted musical comedy 
	we need right now\,” raves the Chicago Tribune – one that proves we’re bet
	ter together. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n
					\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n
					\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n		
			\n				\n				\n				\n				CRITICAL ACCLAIM FOR MRS. DOUBTFIRE\n			\n				\n
					\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				
	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n					– The Telegraph \n			
			\n					“Sharp\, funny\, and full of heart.” \n					\n				\n				\n			\n		
			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n					– The H
	ollywood Reporter \n					\n					“A feel-good\, family-friendly musical com
	edy that delivers.” \n					\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				
	\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n					– Chicago Tribune/Daily News \n		
				\n					“This lovable\, big-hearted musical comedy delivers a good time 
	for all ages.” \n					\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n
					\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				
	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				PERFORMA
