	\n				TICKETING INFO\nSeason tickets are available. 6-show packages start 
	at just $34 per-show. \nTickets are $46 and are available online or by cal
	ling TUTS Guest Services at 713-558-8887. Tickets will also available in p
	erson Monday through Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Office\, l
	ocated in the Hobby Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are available
	 for parties of 10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of access
	ibility options for guests.Learn more about accessible performances and ot
	her services here. \nRush tickets will be available for $35 at the box off
	ice for mezzanine and gallery seating starting 2 hours prior to curtain. \
